# Study pipeline local artifacts
study_pipeline/studied_repos/*/checkout/

# Study pipeline throwaway clones (see ADR-0021).
# Cloned third-party repositories are NEVER committed. They are large, they are
# not ours, and committing one would silently add another project's content to
# this repository. Nothing under this directory may ever be tracked.
.study-workspace/

# Integration/benchmark run artifacts.
# build_system_b() defaults its trace path to the CWD, and the benchmark script
# writes its trace next to where it is run; both are run-scoped outputs, not
# sources. Tests pass tmp_path explicitly (fixed 2026-10-16); these entries
# cover interactive runs.
system_b_trace.jsonl
benchmark_trace.jsonl

